 "remarks": "Welcome to Piper, Norwalk's newest luxury community. This new-construction, two-story residence offers 2 bedrooms, a large loft, and 2 full baths, with dramatic two-story ceilings in the main living area. The open first floor features a kitchen with quartz counters, tile backsplash, GE stainless appliances, and large windows as well as a bedroom with walk in closet and bath. Upstairs, a large loft space, bedroom and bath with generous closet space. In-unit washer/dryer, keyless entry, and smart thermostat included. Direct access is available from the garage. Amenities include: resort-style pool, firepits and grills, rooftop deck, fitness center and studio, resident lounges, on-site co-working spaces, pet spa, and indoor pet play area. Next door to restaurants and coffee shops, and minutes to SoNo dining and nightlife, the Maritime Aquarium, Wall Street Theater, Norwalk Art Space, and Mathews Park. Metro-North and I-95 nearby for Stamford, New Haven, and NYC; close to Westport, New Canaan, and Fairfield. A great fit if you're relocating to the area, between homes, work nearby are renovating or simply want the comfort of home, plus wonderful amenities without the outdoor upkeep. Special Offer: 2 months free rent if move in occurs within 60 days of applying.",
